[00:00.00][by:刀丛寻诗]
[01:29.09]Where
[01:29.09]何方
[01:30.18]were you
[01:30.18]你在何方
[01:34.56]when I was burned and broken
[01:34.56]当我燃烧毁灭之时
[01:41.13]While the days slipped by
[01:41.13]当这日子
[01:45.00]from my window watching
[01:45.00]从我窗前溜走
[01:52.14]Where
[01:52.14]何方
[01:54.09]were you
[01:54.09]你在何方
[01:58.00]when I was hurt and I was helpless
[01:58.00]当我受伤无助之时
[02:03.85]
[02:05.52]Because the things you say and the things you do surround me
[02:05.52]只因为你所言你所做仍在我心
[02:14.58]
[02:16.18]While you were hanging yourself on someone else`s words
[02:16.18]当你陷在别人的只言片语中
[02:22.90]Dying to believe in what you heard
[02:22.90]为你所听到的不惜去死之时
[02:27.86]I was staring straight into the shining sun
[02:27.86]我正在凝视耀眼的太阳
[02:36.49]
[02:44.91]Lost in thought
[02:44.91]堕于幻想
[02:49.94]and lost in time
[02:49.94]溺于时光
[02:53.22]
[02:55.76]While the seeds of life and the seeds of change were planted
[02:55.76]直至生活与变革的种子播种
[03:04.18]
[03:06.23]Outside the rain
[03:06.23]帘外雨幕
[03:11.84]fell dark and slow
[03:11.84]缓入黑夜
[03:14.67]
[03:16.95]While I pondered on this dangerous but irresistible pastime
[03:16.95]我所沉思的危险不过是习惯性的消遣
[03:26.10]
[03:27.33]I took a heavenly ride through our silence
[03:27.33]我搭乘天国马车打我们的沉默间经过
[03:32.86]I knew the moment had arrived
[03:32.86]深知这时刻已经到来——
[03:39.04]For killing the past and coming back to life
[03:39.04]告别过去，重返现实
[03:49.93]
[04:32.84]I took a heavenly ride through our silence
[04:32.84]我搭乘天国马车打我们的沉默间经过
[04:38.51]I knew the waiting had began
[04:38.51]深知这等待已经开始
[04:42.57]
[04:46.83]And headed straight ......
[04:46.83]抬起头来
[04:47.19]into the shining sun
[04:47.19]沉溺在那耀眼的光中
[06:07.23]
